{title: For All You've Done (FJ_52_en)}
{subtitle: Mein Retter, Erlöser}
{song_number: 52}
{key: E}
{tempo: 132}
{language: en}

{comment: Verse}
[E]My Saviour, [Esus4]Redeemer,
[E]lifted me from the [Esus4]miry clay.
[E]Almighty [Esus4]forever,
[E]I will never be the [Esus4]same.
'Cause You came [C#m7]near,
from the everlasting [A]to the world we live,
[E]the Father's only [B]Son.

{start_of_chorus}
And You [E]lived, and You [B/D#]died,
and You [A/C#]rose again on high. [B]And You [E]opened the [B/D#]way
for the world [A/C#]to live again.
[B]Hallelu[A]jah [B]for all You've [E]done.
{end_of_chorus}
